@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

title IceFireDB System Architecture

package "IceFireDB" {
  RECTANGLE "Redis Proxy" as RedisProxy {
    + Proxy Redis commands
    + Synchronize instructions
    + Forward to Redis storage
    + Support command categories
  }

  RECTANGLE "PubSub" as PubSub {
    + Redis-compatible Pub/Sub
    + Multi-node operation
    + NAT/private network support
    + Peer discovery & routing
  }

  RECTANGLE "SQLite SQL Handler" as SQLiteHandler {
    + Internal SQL result parsing
    + MySQL protocol handling
  }
}

package "External Systems" {
  RECTANGLE "Redis Standalone" as RedisStandalone
  RECTANGLE "Redis Cluster" as RedisCluster
  RECTANGLE "Redis Applications" as RedisApps
  RECTANGLE "Pub/Sub Clients" as PubSubClients
  RECTANGLE "SQL Clients" as SQLClients
}

RedisProxy --> RedisStandalone : Writes data
RedisProxy --> RedisCluster : Writes data
RedisProxy <-- RedisApps : Proxies commands
PubSub <--> PubSubClients : Publish/Subscribe
SQLiteHandler <-- SQLClients : Handles results

note right of RedisProxy
  Supports standalone and 
  clustered Redis modes
end note

note right of PubSub
  Uses Kademlia DHT with 
  libp2p/IPFS-style routing
end note

note right of SQLiteHandler
  Internal MySQL-style 
  result processing only
end note

@enduml
